able at `DEBUG`. The\ntranscript and approval description use plain language while preserving\nthe Switch-to-Manual flow and shell allow-list guard.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/434260c2-4bed-5449-a0b4-95de592be3ec)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"18b84cd3017a34618973848a3c8dfac95ad7bbae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/18b84cd3017a34618973848a3c8dfac95ad7bbae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/42afcded97029070f393232778c84aaf3b69fb1c","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqiIFBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAu3wQAFJ/Hn44tlNXRnK2BLC4bays\n+d/QIeTZExnZQBRO8eI5SfUMO6pTz9BFYo8qNivOoBhwQEf/3XZD6Pl3bxEvJ63g\nte3YV53kSW67LR53aMJ7scrGcZuR2gKmk01gFwCpvWyb7kRDAuawNj1EYrfyuX1D\nvuDqnjfnVgP1g4DhPCS+kuTNLUtzSul2G94i5FJBkj4PGYqv9Sp+oJ/maaE4hSUA\nfdhWyJr7fIa2P+Hz78XjvyiJylSYSKrVaDw7bDmwg5eDLce/wdJWJtmpUvHNwZ8j\nZ0sJgpnHjbsKomQuIiEPXAlON2+nrlg0CpAzZaX9Br3uzKlXwsHAAbrc0zAsksBY\ncFUMDuJFo5Yfmh0kSAE3B1BZQDj+rMEt6OZXrwNI1F0FyRW8G29qEF/c4z0iqnxv\nbCZ9mCQLBqHkkANlq0ZNq9Yzn4Fr8Y7qL889UxY3kaCz71t9qfA4WMfI5t0rGxPP\nj3EncHDRWBuojUzC5xJO845ZZqpjePP3VFjOx3TT5/RXYY6xuP8tR4RGeidbnaGt\nnMeHkEcrzP5c2D2JoH0cy/nARyYSvdvurWzlhlsDk4k4yHBvJWAHPCMFj0DdPIMu\nTUPqtaHqfzvrfYkhgqfqJDheYUA7Htl8TYgv2kTnoMMfGfKIdUljjzf9FWSI7Kr9\njoDJl3WiZ8fvG+KlJ6J0\n=/VV8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 18b84cd3017a34618973848a3c8dfac95ad7bbae\nparent c961e31debedcf189ac937f5087fb529238f1ee3\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1787330881 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787330881 -0400\n\nfix(code): simplify Auto fallback copy (#5670)\n\nAuto fallback prompts now explain that review is needed without exposing\ninternal denial and availability counters.\n\n---\n\nThreshold reasons and counters remain available at `DEBUG`. The\ntranscript and approval description use plain language while preserving\nthe Switch-to-Manual flow and shell allow-list guard.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/434260c2-4bed-5449-a0b4-95de592be3ec)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-21T16:48:02Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/42afcded97029070f393232778c84aaf3b69fb1c","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/42afcded97029070f393232778c84aaf3b69fb1c","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/42afcded97029070f393232778c84aaf3b69fb1c/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{