ts\nbefore merging.\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ca49a354b6cdf3f9848230d1c61128a9d428c97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/9ca49a354b6cdf3f9848230d1c61128a9d428c97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/886de7149147a0e5e271ce99270b49781db0df38","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhxx9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOcUQAFlOSiuADOiHZJ8BkboSsSb3\nPjvrUEZTnSwTIZGV9dRJNrq+RKeiYa074gAQl9zXrgtHQ8b7kFaA2s6jE8GEMt4v\nCV2SJ/R/65GZdFEnqq99899TMZY7DXfzG1p/WbdTgb2UNKYV7HRWVTs7hiaQ1cM6\nWGyKydhZOWxN//7eahpJ1fD3h0IgO6qNWITsj4Uc/QpMtbdUpaYOhRofKsVaM3AL\n3YTmUyVV/EmAYf/K38iHZSldcibZx3P05jsFUBSn0XWnp7AusoLlP3VSZOHLD2ir\nXsq8eYTHGb0m1Ks2Q5iDx9nTst+B1mEbHIAT2nf95qNIyiDmqPxEk5Zr2Ijozc3C\nd/uIbntmR++QSTqKID+NYaquK2FkeKqpIZdspgHCCjjDzl9Jw5ViotkSxj2LcMyq\nKtIS+nbLKa6413cGOO9yWHQizU2kObHudNqX3lwVVxWPDC/7CIqYcc3tOLwEoNve\nmqmgXrzZwZxlidGVAAmzugL0GG3yD7nsdPFdqXgMdtTgXUh2Dez05PZ32eDwy2WF\nLmYeV5pbGOwikpXtuBuPk/eiKCd1AiZDXna8ekSn+8zxUC6luPZy8mTk3qS0PDxq\nDRo9d21YOvDI3zpGZmINr4Jn/O7GZlKpIusoWDVofyWz5Tvjp0HR7Eyiz/PCvzaY\nM/62qUanvIWNco/ls4tZ\n=mds2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 9ca49a354b6cdf3f9848230d1c61128a9d428c97\nparent 484693d99b42eb2ae45ffa240ad2556489962d4e\nauthor langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot] <248757908+langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1787239548 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787239548 -0400\n\nchore(deps): raise dependency minimums for `deepagents-code` (#5710)\n\nRaises the LangChain-ecosystem dependency lower bounds (`langchain*`,\n`langgraph*`, `langsmith*`, `deepagents*`) for `deepagents-code` to the\nlatest compatible stable PyPI release, and regenerates every affected\n`uv.lock`. Upper bounds, extras, and markers are preserved; exact `==`\npins are left alone.\n\nRaised 2 minimum(s):\n\n| Manifest | Dependency | Change |\n|---|---|---|\n| `libs/code/pyproject.toml` | `langchain` | `langchain>=1.3.15,<2.0.0`\n→ `langchain>=1.3.16,<2.0.0` |\n| `libs/code/pyproject.toml` | `langchain-anthropic` |\n`langchain-anthropic>=1.6.0,<2.0.0` →\n`langchain-anthropic>=1.6.1,<2.0.0` |\n\nOpened automatically by `raise_langchain_minimums.yml`. Review the\nraised bounds against any compatibility notes in the manifest comments\nbefore merging.\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-20T15:25:49Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/886de7149147a0e5e271ce99270b49781db0df38","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/886de7149147a0e5e271ce99270b49781db0df38","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/886de7149147a0e5e271ce99270b49781db0df38/comments","author":{"login":"langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot]","id":248757908,"node_id":"BOT_kgDODtO-lA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/2441712?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/langchain-oss-automated-triage%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/langchain-oss-automated-triage","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langchain-oss-automated-triage%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langchain-oss-automated-triage%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langchain-oss-automated-triage%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langchain-oss-automated-triage%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langchain-oss-automated-triage%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langchain-oss-automated-triage%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langchain-oss-automated-triage%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langchain-oss-automated-triage%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langchain-oss-automated-triage%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"484693d99b42eb2ae45ffa240ad2556489962d4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/484693d99b42eb2ae45ffa240ad2556489962d4e","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/484693d99b42eb2ae45ffa240ad2556489962d4e"}]},{"sha":"484693d99b42eb2ae45ffa240ad2556489962d4e","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDQ4NDY5M2Q5OWI0MmViMmFlNDVmZmEyNDBhZDI1NTY0ODk5NjJkNGU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-20T15:23:55Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-20T15:23:55Z"},"message":"ci(infra): fence package names in auto-created bump PR titles (#5708)\n\nAuto-created dependency bump PRs (e.g. #5707, #5704) now title\nthemselves with fenced package names — `` chore(deps): bump `deepagents`\npin in `deepagents-code` to 0.7.9 `` instead of `chore(deps): bump\ndeepagents pin in deepagents-code to 0.7.9` — matching the repo\nconvention of wrapping named entities in backticks.\n\n---\n\nBoth workflows that generate these titles (one drives the SDK pin bump,\nthe other the daily `genai-prices` bump) build the commit message and PR\ntitle from the same string, so both the commit and the title get the\nfencing. The version stays bare, matching the `release(scope): x.y.z`\nconvention and previously merged pin-bump titles.\n\nThe `genai-prices` workflow retitles its open bump PR on every run, so\nan in-flight PR picks up the new title automatically the next time the\nworkflow runs.\n\nNo release-please or title-lint impact: the description after\n`type(scope):` is free-form for both, and the `chore(deps):` type/scope\npair that keeps these out of the changelog is unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"7cf725906915470763f7c82e6bcf87763950536e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/7cf725906915470763f7c82e6bcf87763950536e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/484693d99b42eb2ae45ffa240ad2556489962d4e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhxwLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAm0QAEenGYy4rnEAYCvdpLl+uzVj\nI+9JT4qgnMeRgSlDQs3mGwo4BQngRXJdr3BbqW+vQ4HyVKDHE/R0Hra7NLpru8th\nyBGcX3rTQzZfdJQyEU/vRFOY/DhBBHy7kCCOUunKXPT8BBC4H0iayWIuLt8uN+22\nePEjAQ8JA59ffTM6RLKH3WSfOMlR8xyZb+PentRqaQ43micirhSIoUKOwZuD6s2A\n2LRbN3qIuntfOco8qwwfJv0UKIh0nVsdIpsSwOeL2QJJyVuj87AZwF5em9wBj8mT\nz7st7tJI6Ud+gptSowAVZAhOPLOiBNyx6eg9Hl2b8avpmpF2KOeF0d1DCPosd2rl\ndFU+gglTRIFVo/YWjvDwbi5DIFnTcLstcqZxZynb+dIIC5V+HCqdcJXMJLv6cIBw\nFLt594Hg5tVtR5xjnCwn+A5kJO3DSZPdDI+Ykeu8omVb82RVmM3p093YYTo/xMMX\nIPpLSocuFSwHogWWl0SwBgyDpSZjxlMZPjhWz5RTHrYX6ZMvEc6QmvSb9Bqyijq+\nbSb7gBESBUURq/nFNNChWI9uTlZvtqo1N0E4uF0MHE7dB1WMgUY21R2DRmW1xivp\nPVLbxcb2d408we9Mzg2QPen1XIsKHQOjxGg8Rj+tVgXZG/L39jGe0Je3z6nP6dIV\nX3cutfknWfhsb8l4AH9D\n=USYM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 7cf725906915470763f7c82e6bcf87763950536e\nparent cf939b3f86fc86d74e389924da7a79894d849fcd\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1787239435 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787239435 -0400\n\nci(infra): fence package names in auto-created bump PR titles (#5708)\n\nAuto-created dependency bump PRs (e.g. #5707, #5704) now title\nthemselves with fenced package names — `` chore(deps): bump `deepagents`\npin in `deepagents-code` to 0.7.9 `` instead of `chore(deps): bump\ndeepagents pin in deepagents-code to 0.7.9` — matching the repo\nconvention of wrapping named entities in backticks.\n\n---\n\nBoth workflows that generate these titles (one drives the SDK pin bump,\nthe other the daily `genai-prices` bump) build the commit message and PR\ntitle from the same string, so both the commit and the title get the\nfencing. The version stays bare, matching the `release(scope): x.y.z`\nconvention and previously merged pin-bump titles.\n\nThe `genai-prices` workflow retitles its open bump PR on every run, so\nan in-flight PR picks up the new title automatically the next time the\nworkflow runs.\n\nNo release-please or title-lint impact: the description after\n`type(scope):` is free-form for both, and the `chore(deps):` type/scope\npair that keeps these out of the changelog is unchanged.","verified_at":"2026-08-20T15:23:56Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/484693d99b42eb2ae45ffa240ad2556489962d4e","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/484693d99b42eb2ae45ffa240ad2556489962d4e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/484693d99b42eb2ae45ffa240ad2556489962d4e/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_ur