mOTM5YjNmODZmYzg2ZDc0ZTM4OTkyNGRhN2E3OTg5NGQ4NDlmY2Q","commit":{"author":{"name":"langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot]","email":"248757908+langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-08-20T15:23:32Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-20T15:23:32Z"},"message":"chore(deps): raise dependency minimums for `deepagents` (#5709)\n\nRaises the LangChain-ecosystem dependency lower bounds (`langchain*`,\n`langgraph*`, `langsmith*`, `deepagents*`) for `deepagents` to the\nlatest compatible stable PyPI release, and regenerates every affected\n`uv.lock`. Upper bounds, extras, and markers are preserved; exact `==`\npins are left alone.\n\nRaised 2 minimum(s):\n\n| Manifest | Dependency | Change |\n|---|---|---|\n| `libs/deepagents/pyproject.toml` | `langchain` |\n`langchain>=1.3.15,<2.0.0` → `langchain>=1.3.16,<2.0.0` |\n| `libs/deepagents/pyproject.toml` | `langchain-anthropic` |\n`langchain-anthropic>=1.6.0,<2.0.0` →\n`langchain-anthropic>=1.6.1,<2.0.0` |\n\nOpened automatically by `raise_langchain_minimums.yml`. Review the\nraised bounds against any compatibility notes in the manifest comments\nbefore merging.\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a435e9384e57b1d3e94ccbd9aa31a20456ae5dc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/a435e9384e57b1d3e94ccbd9aa31a20456ae5dc3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/cf939b3f86fc86d74e389924da7a79894d849fcd","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhxv0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAg/sQAHWGuILGvl3NUtaF5C2DCSgE\nUlSWtdFqRMA5zskNmkEZ57+wSJi8pvQ6WheY0ujSHSDe/LYYe32ZOsrRrxMpOCzm\naRsYHprh7bGBlQ4zSvL8x/XTXac9kc+yWwf0Fp6iQHqBzlZLbdSrGy4+XVRHUFHP\nPsIFbNVn1vHhxslLhhShAZshHXCVjsdYnuBkevfye+k3vL31gX9JDXA3yP4j7MxR\nfUMvX+pvYprAJFQtYrGna90l4CfWTwEkTZ4y8JgQlUcV1Q77ndOI7qN