9bd088a69ed9b9510391daf247a9dbb9dfbea6bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/9bd088a69ed9b9510391daf247a9dbb9dfbea6bf","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/9bd088a69ed9b9510391daf247a9dbb9dfbea6bf"}]},{"sha":"9bd088a69ed9b9510391daf247a9dbb9dfbea6bf","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDliZDA4OGE2OWVkOWI5NTEwMzkxZGFmMjQ3YTlkYmI5ZGZiZWE2YmY","commit":{"author":{"name":"langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot]","email":"248757908+langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-08-19T21:53:58Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-19T21:53:58Z"},"message":"chore(deps): raise dependency minimums for `deepagents-code` (#5663)\n\nRaises the LangChain-ecosystem dependency lower bounds (`langchain*`,\n`langgraph*`, `langsmith*`, `deepagents*`) for `deepagents-code` to the\nlatest compatible stable PyPI release, and regenerates every affected\n`uv.lock`. Upper bounds, extras, and markers are preserved; exact `==`\npins are left alone.\n\nRaised 3 minimum(s):\n\n| Manifest | Dependency | Change |\n|---|---|---|\n| `libs/code/pyproject.toml` | `langgraph-sdk` |\n`langgraph-sdk>=0.4.2,<1.0.0` → `langgraph-sdk>=0.4.3,<1.0.0` |\n| `libs/code/pyproject.toml` | `langchain-anthropic` |\n`langchain-anthropic>=1.5.6,<2.0.0` →\n`langchain-anthropic>=1.6.0,<2.0.0` |\n| `libs/code/pyproject.toml` | `langchain-openai` |\n`langchain-openai>=1.5.2,<2.0.0` → `langchain-openai>=1.6.0,<2.0.0` |\n\nOpened automatically by `raise_langchain_minimums.yml`. Review the\nraised bounds against any compatibility notes in the manifest comments\nbefore merging.\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3920ee738db23fa41b2ecc778048915823df48aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/3920ee738db23fa41b2ecc778048915823df48aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/9bd08