lic","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"80e3d4738e0464cc3a6c5f9dfc27efc0128a9a00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/80e3d4738e0464cc3a6c5f9dfc27efc0128a9a00","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/80e3d4738e0464cc3a6c5f9dfc27efc0128a9a00"}]},{"sha":"80e3d4738e0464cc3a6c5f9dfc27efc0128a9a00","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDgwZTNkNDczOGUwNDY0Y2MzYTZjNWY5ZGZjMjdlZmMwMTI4YTlhMDA","commit":{"author":{"name":"langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot]","email":"248757908+langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-08-19T17:28:54Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-19T17:28:54Z"},"message":"chore(deps): raise dependency minimums for `deepagents-code` (#5647)\n\nRaises the LangChain-ecosystem dependency lower bounds (`langchain*`,\n`langgraph*`, `langsmith*`, `deepagents*`) for `deepagents-code` to the\nlatest compatible stable PyPI release, and regenerates every affected\n`uv.lock`. Upper bounds, extras, and markers are preserved; exact `==`\npins are left alone.\n\nRaised 3 minimum(s):\n\n| Manifest | Dependency | Change |\n|---|---|---|\n| `libs/code/pyproject.toml` | `langgraph-runtime-inmem` |\n`langgraph-runtime-inmem>=0.32.5,<1.0.0` →\n`langgraph-runtime-inmem>=0.32.6,<1.0.0` |\n| `libs/code/pyproject.toml` | `langchain-openai` |\n`langchain-openai>=1.5.1,<2.0.0` → `langchain-openai>=1.5.2,<2.0.0` |\n| `libs/code/pyproject.toml` | `langsmith` |\n`langsmith[sandbox]>=0.11.0` → `langsmith[sandbox]>=0.11.1` |\n\nOpened automatically by `raise_langchain_minimums.yml`. Review the\nraised bounds against any compatibility notes in the manifest comments\nbefore merging.\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b1d8ac6ea30fe781a31251a16f5a888cd94be4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/3b1d8ac6ea30fe781a31251a16f5a888cd94be4f"},"url":"https://api.github