or":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-18T22:08:26Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-18T22:08:26Z"},"message":"feat(code): open footer pickers with `ctrl+click` (#5611)\n\nModel and reasoning-effort labels in the footer can now open their\nexisting pickers with Ctrl+click.\n\n---\n\nThe modifier guard prevents ordinary footer clicks from opening a modal.\nCtrl-modified pointer movement underlines only the target under the\npointer; the hint clears on the next unmodified movement or when the\npointer leaves, matching the modifier information terminal mouse events\nprovide. Effort selection enters the existing `/effort` queue so it\ncannot overtake pending prompts, and width-aware truncation removes\nhidden hit targets.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/deda64b8-90d8-7b5c-3778-0a0953085701)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d25aa976fa067e10d7013a73fd9783b00053a05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/6d25aa976fa067e10d7013a73fd9783b00053a05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/ee339fb8c39a1432f0cc12c181431c60b4e235f9","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhNfaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0/8QAA0w+Ko1XmzFDDx9mkrv1uaM\nrKSFRsX63aPI3rpi5jfmsM/NRNFFbhdeqH4b3A+ZCojb/VAy8ePCkwm3aeWWmkrV\nykGwriA/wnp3p2PjTTBwMuPkWTHOVUWqUhz1JIeL+eziXOQ7ONaLJK4g5t9Horyw\nd71MIIaBmWipRoprqSesJw4YjPRhLwikdgqUDDwS5DpspvFryPamo16nXJ6SsN7j\n4MByTdHHXMga0BhLhikdxHLObukhHJMYfoimdmSJ+TiKEpDpaVsum2ypiJ1gY++t\nkLWV8n66ybg/25NtlE6KI67knjcS9vWK5M6PmDP1dwjUONxOqopZcHr1QAAD/Ryi\npVsJpJvFoxIh6WZ9/luFxK8RYy8S2GFfrfk/6aqgQImxzu/vJwsvVR3aqd0MSsDC\nGvv7zbpzfnProgXpcf6hk5Dp0Ue2ju1Rcw79A2nsaAmzyf8jOwECnRmlp0lEosce\nyYb/I4jl39QjlqKCcInjpTN5/EvDTgyseRQWZwdbxUs49uwioqDTGDifdlGJJk0b\noIY+43revpyZNbrAGrqLgKdriw/jHj5YZAfqiCuRoezEo7BaXVGkTzT1Ln9V6I8m\nUYWlvLCcOdu1BpHZP+mLicMGk5uMPNy44dBbusB+BSZ6fHNrZ9SuMho2l/eVE5Pj\nBtS9MJfElTMUJIKFobZM\n=sEXx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 6d25aa976fa067e10d7013a73fd9783b00053a05\nparent 6b65f3c0f9f2a712ddbd07aac394fe775b3ab425\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1787090906 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787090906 -0400\n\nfeat(code): open footer pickers with `ctrl+click` (#5611)\n\nModel and reasoning-effort labels in the footer can now open their\nexisting pickers with Ctrl+click.\n\n---\n\nThe modifier guard prevents ordinary footer clicks from opening a modal.\nCtrl-modified pointer movement underlines only the target under the\npointer; the hint clears on the next unmodified movement or when the\npointer leaves, matching the modifier information terminal mouse events\nprovide. Effort selection enters the existing `/effort` queue so it\ncannot overtake pending prompts, and width-aware truncation removes\nhidden hit targets.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/deda64b8-90d8-7b5c-3778-0a0953085701)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-18T22:08:27Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ee339fb8c39a1432f0cc12c181431c60b4e235f9","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ee339fb8c39a1432f0cc12c181431c60b4e235f9","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ee339fb8c39a1432f0cc12c181431c60b4e235f9/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/g