m1O5k\nCHFwam3tVQ3F7B06oeldT1TIpUu64yQ+cyKS8qhLLIUhENAJmLWNNALeP7uuQs0s\n5qitzbNzyI4JvtWf14dyRufluNrjmi4aRb42LltdbL8pPvG/eUdRmlXH3OhSRunJ\nn+Fc+schOsWc1NP3LBt463aOM60Wqq6ig+clIE76EQ1JsLohvtpkfH76f7DtAZ1l\nNxm75BaA85AiSte2Zeb0\n=eLF+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 50d7e0dc1593cc8065928a6c74d70abf2ab64677\nparent 927da948281f07355be3795086acb8f884ab6022\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1787089258 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787089258 -0400\n\nfix(infra): use `OPENAI_API_KEY` for OpenWiki (#5613)\n\nOpenWiki now reads the gateway credential from the environment-scoped\n`OPENAI_API_KEY` secret.\n\n---\n\nThe workflow referenced `LS_GATEWAY_OPENAI_API_KEY`, so GitHub injected\nan empty value despite the `openwiki` environment being selected.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/ba52484f-1462-5bca-840f-be89a83fd97d)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-18T21:40:59Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/889afae1c51931fab0411455ec7a92713c43ef85","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/889afae1c51931fab0411455ec7a92713c43ef85","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/889afae1c51931fab0411455ec7a92713c43ef85/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"927da948281f07355be3795086acb8f884ab6022","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/927da948281f07355be3795086acb8f884ab6022","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/927da948281f07355be3795086acb8f884ab6022"}]},{"sha":"927da948281f07355be3795086acb8f884ab6022","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDkyN2RhOTQ4MjgxZjA3MzU1YmUzNzk1MDg2YWNiOGY4ODRhYjYwMjI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Colin Francis","email":"131073567+colifran@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-08-18T21:13:35Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-18T21:13:35Z"},"message":"fix(repo): replace blocked `create-pull-request` action (#5608)\n\n## Summary\n\nThe scheduled OpenWiki workflow always failed because\n`peter-evans/create-pull-request` is not on the enterprise actions\nallowlist. Replaced that step with inline `git` + `gh` CLI (both\npreinstalled on the runner, so no allowlisted action needed), preserving\nthe original behavior: stage only OpenWiki paths, no-op when there are\nno changes, and reuse the existing PR instead of opening duplicates.","tree":{"sha":"61133e8884bdf855d149203aa0ebc0fc1a002cfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/61133e8884bdf855d149203aa0ebc0fc1a002cfb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/927da948281f07355be3795086acb8f884ab6022","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhMr/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgDYQAKXGyxZ5aDs9G18PZDuRiGtZ\nb4Hy/Hq1/k77i8/hayl4IHyesXpUrXgsO6NkGosmxSq//wxot9acEdPtX05LKqF+\nS+Ai1o5+YJmPozjJa9F9oXgJp+tCROyEDqil8hoJLoRi96b9uNLT/VX24bV0vjkI\nKoPAot6ioJbjAGobU6Tzdp/5o1xu9954j1x/xpJBKXVW32rnl0yGxElQ36PLrYvQ\nkjPzuew2+C9osUKP1VR42gjgq6lk/9pGINp6B8wqu555chU6doQjh9la4gfESeB/\nwdvE9NQwYec58pZG9wLyxIbLIcUJOz2t+mtM3AkrGQ31aBRZjvRCHSYq3qVXuGiU\nH0HMAWuBS1hzBTue2vIo0SExCeAmi+VdJMO+5/ap7swwYKm5gagPVkvij5WHvPhg\nk0zewjgk4z4Y40arAO0ypCS/fvuVE/qr5lIDAoBEQYtIkt8OkYD2cTZJaTP2MPTb\n755MLQeJ1DEagFMMpLFudSdhY+CTg8BUfjXCZMy4qwbR7C8H6A58to55QSmq4c7w\nDiiuH8rRi7ucGcMvkjAWM7Ucghc58u4c3CFP+yfzstQJVB4Ak9Y3bJyYLbEBsCwM\nerU9DwiQEWKAQjMqGfGz4lr9jra7qaYRAMvkvxXzjAXugpith2Fv3mdF354lcvZr\nnrtC2EdcUALbm36lu/d2\n=jAVF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 61133e8884bdf855d149203aa0ebc0fc1a002cfb\nparent ab82d48cc012c5a991660ad53785c2e26030596e\nauthor Colin Francis <131073567+colifran@users.noreply.github.com> 1787087615 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787087615 -0700\n\nfix(repo): replace blocked `create-pull-request` action (#5608)\n\n## Summary\n\nThe scheduled OpenWiki workflow always failed because\n`peter-evans/create-pull-request` is not on the enterprise actions\nallowlist. Replaced that step with inline `git` + `gh` CLI (both\npreinstalled on the runner, so no allowlisted action needed), preserving\nthe original behavior: stage only OpenWiki paths, no-op when there are\nno changes, and reuse the existing PR instead of opening duplicates.","verified_at":"2026-08-18T21:13:36Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/927da948281f07355be3795086acb8f884ab6022","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/927da948281f07355be3795086acb8f884ab6022","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/927da948281f07355be3795086acb8f884ab6022/comments","author":{"login":"colifran","id":131073567,"node_id":"U_kgDOB9AGHw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131073567?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/colifran","html_url":"https://github.com/colifran","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colifran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colifran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colifran/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colifran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colifran/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colifran/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colifran/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colifran/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colifran/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"ab82d48cc012c5a991660ad53785c2e26030596e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ab82d48cc012c5a991660ad53785c2e26030596e","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ab82d48cc012c5a991660ad53785c2e26030596e"}]},{"sha":"ab82d48cc012c5a991660ad53785c2e26030596e","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGFiODJkNDhjYzAxMmM1YTk5MTY2MGFkNTM3ODVjMmUyNjAzMDU5NmU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Alexander Olsen","email":"aolsenjazz@gmail.com","date":"2026-08-18T19:33:55Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-18T19:33:55Z"},"message":"fix(code): make `/offload` interruptible (#5590)\n\n`/offload` and `/compact` can now be interrupted with Escape as their\nprogress hint promises.\n\n---\n\nPreviously, the interface showed `esc to interrupt` while offloading,\nbut pressing Escape did nothing. On a slow or stuck offload, users\nremained on the `Offloading` state with no way to regain control without\nwaiting for the request to finish or fail.\n\nNow Escape cancels an in-progress offload and returns the interface to\nan idle, usable state. If the offload had already completed when\ncancellation arrived, its result is preserved; otherwise, the pending\noperation is cleaned up so the conversation can continue normally.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/d5b34378-8e7e-57e7-8e22-82cb74c789f6)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Alexander Olsen <13665641+aolsenjazz@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"8025f372a666bd574314fbea9d34e5487499fe2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/8025f372a666bd574314fbea9d34e5487499fe2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/ab82d48cc012c5a991660ad53785c2e26030596e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhLOjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtPgQAIpUniJHj/NnqksoA/xp1qck\npRmCTk3JpNKRIo6tEl+wd5+EfjeS6PT8+ckloIgb7NxS2T/8a3mZmbqE+VcX68Px\n9P0hbC0fY/ljcfjgc947O4eWBs+8MH0satw1iPRG4rWwskMJIcqqpoIDKaS/bu2N\nNwk8IO8h7XNC3KwZAp9sKgSf0bhVgNE6u06+ZlOYvfd3J+rTUy1ltI8ap2qDgd+k\n6e7apx82meZdUABUKq4n2XDQsaiP0/rMVbRp/U8rYMwkbuI9la18Hn3e+yfTnVZD\nv2Q2x0zmhnX1NpJEpckQFOvx98E5q4y1lT28luM4wStrzBThz1lxuuFP/xJWOWay\nGlUUZuClRp11iK07H1p4Nz4IppoKY+MTqunftn6yitJUd/6PQl34XV4NDTuy0fFH\nk9r2oU1gyuwlWP2kIHGzINP7UxMkENQxmAPIM79tUAk33pVLREIqrxE7MI0Fh71s\nmXOu19igqtfc4AAPJID4kTrTK63OM1nSe14ASZLnOiLPmnFwn5+GHWBAQEGOK7Jb\nV23u1RfhgM1xL2pbqCvEH8VY8hXQK4uZx3K+gVFfMtPCcz2r9p28DsmdbN7/P/aE\nnLDu/35nMtv0fxdNLDACap9FkM6DgZRHozkVn4JgPEZpuwN7TaHT9Eyzs1H9ud+z\nfD8mVobRkmBc/rpJ282D\n=PG7N\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 8025f372a666bd574314fbea9d34e5487499fe2d\nparent 575a8acb0307bbea9e08f4f8c15d850580a55cb3\nauthor Alexander Olsen <aolsenjazz@gmail.com> 1787081635 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787081635 -0400\n\nfix(code): make `/offload` interruptible (#5590)\n\n`/offload` and `/compact` can now be interrupted with Escape as their\nprogress hint promises.\n\n---\n\nPreviously, the interface showed `esc to interrupt` while offloading,\nbut pressing Escape did nothing. On a slow or stuck offload, users\nremained on the `Offloading` state with no way to regain control without\nwaiting for the request to finish or fail.\n\nNow Escape cancels an in-progress offload and returns the interface to\nan idle, usable state. If the offload had already completed when\ncancellation arrived, its result is preserved; otherwise, the pending\noperation is cleaned up so the conversation can continue normally.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/d5b34378-8e7e-57e7-8e22-82cb74c789f6)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Alexander Olsen <13665641+aolsenjazz@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-18T19:33:55Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ab82d48cc012c5a991660ad53785c2e26030596e","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ab82d48cc012c5a991660ad53785c2e26030596e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ab82d48cc012c5a991660ad53785c2e26030596e/comments","author":{"login":"aolsenjazz","id":13665641,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjY1NjQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13665641?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aolsenjazz","html_url":"https://github.com/aolsenjazz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aolsenjazz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aolsenjazz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aolsenjazz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aolsenjazz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aolsenjazz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aolsenjazz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aolsenjazz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aolsenjazz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aolsenjazz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"575a8acb0307bbea9e08f4f8c15d850580a55cb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/575a8acb0307bbea9e08f4f8c15d850580a55cb3","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/575a8acb0307bbea9e08f4f8c15d850580a55cb3"}]},{"sha":"575a8acb0307bbea9e08f4f8c15d850580a55cb3","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDU3NWE4YWNiMDMwN2JiZWE5ZTA4ZjRmOGMxNWQ4NTA1ODBhNTVjYjM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-18T19:20:26Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-18T19:20:26Z"},"message":"fix(code): drain hook pipes after timeout (#5606)\n\nHook subprocess timeouts now fully drain their pipe transports instead\nof leaking file descriptors on Python 3.14.\n\n---\n\nTimeout handling previously cancelled bounded communication before\nkilling the child, abandoning stdout and stderr readers. The runner now\nshields communication during deadline enforcement, terminates and reaps\nthe child, and waits for bounded pipe cleanup. A regression test\nverifies timeout cleanup completes without cancelling communication.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/ed465228-7617-573a-a869-f2bf3097ad05)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b4ec55c46750b197cfc8663b9d9f9b33345982f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/1b4ec55c46750b197cfc8663b9d9f9b33345982f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/575a8acb0307bbea9e08f4f8c15d850580a55cb3","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhLB6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArFcQABzZe2hruAiZPqAM9N2y4vw7\nTorhFn2xtMmjGLXSNCkgM4Rgs90z5v0WodHGITRLVqbzq2Uf/QF3eKKDAxbgJYXx\nmOdeqfEBMMcdnILXz9faMMXKotoIZ2x/ADQk4falJB5rYc4dWdcZMjw7dfJTDT7z\n6W4tURFyR1gibu0ITi18Dy0KHASJrn4Awn5B255NbogK4XAN8plAHBGREGoSDJha\nC6BflN6RTqJu00dbT6+rEGL/s+VJ0HrVnL8qqEZu9Aza5mEYFfBvamgQ0KSK3laU\n+hICJsue0i9WVSt5khzq4BSkagJL76VG6h7Usxua61qjDZOUDCfMxZTCi93QvTW4\nWshIlPlUWCO01xY3vofKoJHEOewACvFg54nJS/D27XRkqHEnw+l8tpvkSCUL4SF7\nX5RWCsVI8/NPF0sR1mGIz0cW9iqxsyA2LI4o2Rqol2SkQfwQl3XcWYOerrvIWtEf\n1SMBOlxaAJavIVeHqB25RbmYlYoQrDyOmlEpmUqo2gUoSHbmtL2RJthsfuSFs+EA\nmJ7xBbu+t7vwlt9L/rfokVCeJ+2FgvGP8NZzUeERM7+w1PBTe/DCCyQlkjqEIzY0\n2d03yUDkG+lpt5c/PZRoMIeLcxB81FMmMFsQMLENERJjN9725zm3vt1q6f3xn2pH\nU49nDxZVUCH7NV6s67dm\n=DLmQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 1b4ec55c46750b197cfc8663b9d9f9b33345982f\nparent 749b386f97ed7b920acfd5936b01f8c425976d92\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1787080826 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787080826 -0400\n\nfix(code): drain hook pipes after timeout (#5606)\n\nHook subprocess timeouts now fully drain their pipe transports instead\nof leaking file descriptors on Python 3.14.\n\n---\n\nTimeout handling previously cancelled bounded communication before\nkilling the child, abandoning stdout and stderr readers. The runner now\nshields communication during deadline enforcement, terminates and reaps\nthe child, and waits for bounded pipe cleanup. A regression test\nverifies timeout cleanup completes without cancelling communication.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/ed465228-7617-573a-a869-f2bf3097ad05)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-18T19:20:26Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/575a8acb0307bbea9e08f4f8c15d850580a55cb3","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/575a8acb0307bbea9e08f4f8c15d850580a55cb3","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/575a8acb0307bbea9e08f4f8c15d850580a55cb3/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"749b386f97ed7b920acfd5936b01f8c425976d92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/749b386f97ed7b920acfd5936b01f8c425976d92","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/749b386f97ed7b920acfd5936b01f8c425976d92"}]},{"sha":"749b386f97ed7b920acfd5936b01f8c425976d92","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDc0OWIzODZmOTdlZDdiOTIwYWNmZDU5MzZiMDFmOGM0MjU5NzZkOTI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Hunter Lovell","email":"40191806+hntrl@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-08-18T19:17:44Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-18T19:17:44Z"},"message":"feat(quickjs): add hmac check to snapshot bytes (#5601)\n\n* adds a `snapshot_signing_key` value to `CodeInterpreterMiddleware`\nkwargs that validates snapshots aren't mutated.\n* does this by adding an additional hmac signature state key that's\nupdated in `after_agent` when we have the fully materialized snapshot\nbytes (before we flush to the reducer which uses `bsdiff`), and checks\nin `before_agent` when the state key has been reconstructed by delta\nchannels\n* this is only used by `mode=\"thread\"` since this is when snapshots get\ntriggered\n\nCo-authored-by: Ron F. del Rosario\n<2307524+guerilla7@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3e2d9b0d4c5b05839c5449176eab3f410b39c722","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/3e2d9b0d4c5b05839c5449176eab3f410b39c722"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/749b386f97ed7b920acfd5936b01f8c425976d92","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhK/YCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAC/AQAJ3vYaeRw5tJpu+OufS4+N+u\nJATJO3rf7y/WICTW8CGkVpum2xaegu4rc+B5Lh5c2wKAmnrscgsIbuwk/XwALSOV\nu7nB1JqKulO869rjNvytvP/wArY+AGkQBPzPZNENF2SqzrtDqkwDF3GsF89H6/Hj\nZYCnbTwcD9NNlI0J5zY7b5R5p38DF9IOmuLlJ2WcH7tBr6UvSCsFcP5nhyeH/ilU\nsFHLaA5I1DijeFoLwbwQ4wB1jJXNwqdDt0XzsyEkzy2E2P5PumfBSyuSX69oHmCY\nGrpQ+7VtYJBE+bxCASfTrfcJETDI77zqeJDjY5vO978FDbxhT8Rkxsh9bb+U/67W\neFjN5YVsNk6GP1M7aEj/XHZQXKG9Rv3GlXY4wy0srecWOTWtJYkeYOCXf4hwic6X\nzquGnKF22EhO038TXn4pHpsbQbEJjF9E+KRbuYb8FwU0fSHsZLBxF7ujxTeZcQ3H\nMbbsf4M2+/lqBIKgSyy8IYy3/ZFVoFyuxgswd4zlwy5+zSVwaR8FJMjlcIOU8RlJ\nSltoUJZv0EciChXOnZkEHX2XMub/RQ3jzCnp4WsMZokX9wc9IkknJfKmBErWmyRM\nbkCsviGGyGXH7HZQg2nYWSJh8/DwJIel0JTzm2GIgIPP7WwWj9Bp5sDaDMPDbzuG\nWs3PSG4V+7Z7FcH0Ij+j\n=hCYr\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 3e2d9b0d4c5b05839c5449176eab3f410b39c722\nparent 04de43e05adcbd38f1022f1fafe93f6748c2a032\nauthor Hunter Lovell <40191806+hntrl@users.noreply.github.com> 1787080664 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787080664 -0700\n\nfeat(quickjs): add hmac check to snapshot bytes (#5601)\n\n* adds a `snapshot_signing_key` value to `CodeInterpreterMiddleware`\nkwargs that validates snapshots aren't mutated.\n* does this by adding an additional hmac signature state key that's\nupdated in `after_agent` when we have the fully materialized snapshot\nbytes (before we flush to the reducer which uses `bsdiff`), and checks\nin `before_agent` when the state key has been reconstructed by delta\nchannels\n* this is only used by `mode=\"thread\"` since this is when snapshots get\ntriggered\n\nCo-authored-by: Ron F. del Rosario\n<2307524+guerilla7@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-18T19:17:45Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/749b386f97ed7b920acfd5936b01f8c425976d92","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/749b386f97ed7b920acfd5936b01f8c425976d92","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/749b386f97ed7b920acfd5936b01f8c425976d92/comments","author":{"login":"hntrl","id":40191806,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTkxODA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40191806?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl","html_url":"https://github.com/hntrl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"04de43e05adcbd38f1022f1fafe93f6748c2a032","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/04de43e05adcbd38f1022f1fafe93f6748c2a032","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/04de43e05adcbd38f1022f1fafe93f6748c2a032"}]},{"sha":"04de43e05adcbd38f1022f1fafe93f6748c2a032","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDA0ZGU0M2UwNWFkY2JkMzhmMTAyMmYxZmFmZTkzZjY3NDhjMmEwMzI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-18T18:53:06Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-18T18:53:06Z"},"message":"feat(code,talon): require Python 3.12 or greater (#5603)\n\n`dcode` now requires Python 3.12 or newer (previously 3.11). Users on\n3.11 will need to upgrade their interpreter to install or update to this\nrelease.\n\n---\n\nThe floor bump lets the codebase use 3.12-only syntax and drop 3.11\ncompatibility shims:\n\n- PEP 695 `type` statements replace `TypeAlias` annotations, and generic\nfunctions/classes use type-parameter syntax instead of\n`TypeVar`/`Generic[...]`\n- `Protocol` / `override` import from `typing` instead of\n`typing_extensions`\n- The pre-PEP-706 `tarfile` extraction fallback (needed only for\n3.11.0–3.11.3) is gone; extraction always uses `filter=\"data\"`\n- `uv.lock` re-locks without 3.11-only backports (`tomli`,\n`backports-tarfile`)\n- CI matrices, `ty`, and ruff `target-version` all move to 3.12;\nintegration test defaults and release builds are updated to match\n\n`deepagents-talon` depends on `deepagents-code`, so its floor moves in\nthe same commit — it cannot bump independently without a broken window\nwhere talon allows an interpreter its dependency rejects. This is the\ndeliberate coordinated multi-package bump called out in RELEASING.md, so\nthe `allow-lockfile-release` label is applied to acknowledge the talon\nrelease-please fan-out.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Test plan</summary>\n\n- `ruff check` / `ruff format --check` clean\n- `ty check` clean\n- Full `libs/code` unit suite passes (two pre-existing failures in\n`test_app.py` / `test_server_graph.py` reproduce on the base commit and\nare unrelated)\n- COMMANDS.md catalog check and lockfile freshness hooks pass\n\n</details>","tree":{"sha":"228b203292ac675ddec624dc9ff8ce71bebf6958","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/228b203292ac675ddec624dc9ff8ce71bebf6958"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/04de43e05adcbd38f1022f1fafe93f6748c2a032","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhKoSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5WQQAAN6XMW24hVsAUq4GlnpY5VB\njJP4Le+FL0KJDxAq7AytNXfQmyZalMyBgAaNb+qG8cNOY0zVJSN/cxAXN5QOT+4s\nnA0t6+PA6BHC6HS07fSBmjgTA84wtueuiBgoC58251KTzccKcVLp34BNo5bUjP1A\nGgLaFBgCVWUI3avloLx8gQR6gAT91q7bLpCB0L6+la8SDieRDnBQb8IJBnHb1NHk\nT5HlYbI8MbFns9Nl/eMxSu3Jeh9xWWhWNxPl50xW9pz3L3LWSBB43PwjyVYBowX3\nEPPEAnSx1rIgXyAg40/rVPm9Bl4CkeuaYx567pvqNQaZowb/zDGJYPexHJT4Pv/H\n0rHhlHtjxAi4jeBoqzYPfKj0RySajNDlAxX7bKgqmnkJ3bdPUKU6Coj3CVtJQuIw\nEN29S+pHqSi2AAf67uLb2Dr/5dnnpzm4TYvIxSiel99RbmTChNjeyQWTmnSwmchz\ncLVzPkRYKBfKCjYu//5JBCn0zKwCF4+WZ10kex38CkYwSD9FBmtfQjblhAsox5md\nKnUGJOvoyObtH6G/xB+tQwQWGGK6/u2yySA5F2ycMUbVpPcT9csB8n2QqFI20dBq\nKYWo12EIhdZni9008n2XNRE7mvAxfE26a2E1TwYMuUPSRikVAU93R5LUlqO8A+nn\ne6up9YEGbAF1JoB2PwrH\n=tkyf\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 228b203292ac675ddec624dc9ff8ce71bebf6958\nparent 6a7c7d6575915dbc4b1549133735f50666919979\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1787079186 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787079186 -0400\n\nfeat(code,talon): require Python 3.12 or greater (#5603)\n\n`dcode` now requires Python 3.12 or newer (previously 3.11). Users on\n3.11 will need to upgrade their interpreter to install or update to this\nrelease.\n\n---\n\nThe floor bump lets the codebase use 3.12-only syntax and drop 3.11\ncompatibility shims:\n\n- PEP 695 `type` statements replace `TypeAlias` annotations, and generic\nfunctions/classes use type-parameter syntax instead of\n`TypeVar`/`Generic[...]`\n- `Protocol` / `override` import from `typing` instead of\n`typing_extensions`\n- The pre-PEP-706 `tarfile` extraction fallback (needed only for\n3.11.0–3.11.3) is gone; extraction always uses `filter=\"data\"`\n- `uv.lock` re-locks without 3.11-only backports (`tomli`,\n`backports-tarfile`)\n- CI matrices, `ty`, and ruff `target-version` all move to 3.12;\nintegration test defaults and release builds are updated to match\n\n`deepagents-talon` depends on `deepagents-code`, so its floor moves in\nthe same commit — it cannot bump independently without a broken window\nwhere talon allows an interpreter its dependency rejects. This is the\ndeliberate coordinated multi-package bump called out in RELEASING.md, so\nthe `allow-lockfile-release` label is applied to acknowledge the talon\nrelease-please fan-out.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Test plan</summary>\n\n- `ruff check` / `ruff format --check` clean\n- `ty check` clean\n- Full `libs/code` unit suite passes (two pre-existing failures in\n`test_app.py` / `test_server_graph.py` reproduce on the base commit and\nare unrelated)\n- COMMANDS.md catalog check and lockfile freshness hooks pass\n\n</details>","verified_at":"2026-08-18T18:53:07Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/04de43e05adcbd38f1022f1fafe93f6748c2a032","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/04de43e05adcbd38f1022f1fafe93f6748c2a032","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/04de43e05adcbd38f1022f1fafe93f6748c2a032/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"6a7c7d6575915dbc4b1549133735f50666919979","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/6a7c7d6575915dbc4b1549133735f50666919979","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/6a7c7d6575915dbc4b1549133735f50666919979"}]},{"sha":"6a7c7d6575915dbc4b1549133735f50666919979","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDZhN2M3ZDY1NzU5MTVkYmM0YjE1NDkxMzM3MzVmNTA2NjY5MTk5Nzk","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-18T18:36:48Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-18T18:36:48Z"},"message":"fix(code): keep rapid typing visible (#5424)\n\nRapid typing in the chat input and inline prompts now stays visible\ninstead of disappearing until typing pauses.\n\n---\n\nRapid printable runs previously moved into the hidden paste buffer after\nthree keys. Promotion now waits for an embedded newline to confirm a\nkey-event paste, preserving multiline grouping and collapse behavior\nwithout delaying ordinary typing.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/0ef7a975-3734-b3c2-2791-d503790233a7)\n\n## References\n- Plan:\nhttps://openswe.vercel.app/agents/0ef7a975-3734-b3c2-2791-d503790233a7/plan\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b8be78141658aafb4415e7a0beb244968646c7be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/b8be78141658aafb4415e7a0beb244968646c7be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/6a7c7d6575915dbc4b1549133735f50666919979","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhKZACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+HQQAIjRdKrEX9heLF/Rdxuv1L7T\ncnf1Jqz4P+2ZlyAbTMBekSClRWN+HtoiuiZZaKqa3xZrw3g4UQUE039acS4NT8Ss\nCdbUcwFCjE4zZGJGrOHFkqqTBfss8JotdnjhFZRufCjmnavBTZFnFJGWusbC9ynf\nhWm0QyP9Bz0Ee4iWl259qMnMBX8zvrLm+Cy9knR9cQHogc2yG9uuEmzS2Nzmg12S\nlegPaMMT3HwnLKamhg6uza0eq5n0gosPpaWXIG/o5i081lRB66Q45ECzDLrFSP29\n6QB8j4cCG6EPw11sWaBYEOg3ZxC8sooUGnnvfbYVL8FXsNDfQmtNSV8jbPc9vCC8\n72CPwUSBS1+y2y+wwaXRRq4XuA7fkyu6u4GMaShmkAZ01TmkLRhF0PMPTC8TgRv/\nYMwV750DZ3rqXkQcFLAI20tuo8cJBt4gKKMjLXX90+ra3SidAI3ZvGBvQVDXwbgn\nBuR451k1KbxlW0G70ku/hWJZ7kTHxnIINPAflrUIxk0DH4mPs5hSO+JLN/oTOEsy\nDSTq3yh6IYxq8HXz/tUCazwzT+QVAh78j3K0UjqOvO25TGr4im6vaJE2mEhYoA1h\n7dR0jVrMjyK9il/PSyvkBG7fHtxNQitGuy3sPvAYfWofzH8yvwRMGb/VxqK3Vqlz\n8pNvkeUv3lGvBT9fNPc5\n=ikKr\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree b8be78141658aafb4415e7a0beb244968646c7be\nparent 4bfb6d2360ae1f67595ce75cf64bec023ca897f0\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1787078208 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787078208 -0400\n\nfix(code): keep rapid typing visible (#5424)\n\nRapid typing in the chat input and inline prompts now stays visible\ninstead of disappearing until typing pauses.\n\n---\n\nRapid printable runs previously moved into the hidden paste buffer after\nthree keys. Promotion now waits for an embedded newline to confirm a\nkey-event paste, preserving multiline grouping and collapse behavior\nwithout delaying ordinary typing.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/0ef7a975-3734-b3c2-2791-d503790233a7)\n\n## References\n- Plan:\nhttps://openswe.vercel.app/agents/0ef7a975-3734-b3c2-2791-d503790233a7/plan\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-18T18:36:49Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/6a7c7d6575915dbc4b1549133735f50666919979","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/6a7c7d6575915dbc4b1549133735f50666919979","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/6a7c7d6575915dbc4b1549133735f50666919979/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{