ccurate historical record for reviewers and anyone returning later._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.7.7](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents==0.7.6...deepagents==0.7.7)\n(2026-08-18)\n\n### Bug fixes\n\n- Batched concurrent `ContextHubBackend` mutations to improve SDK\nbackend behavior\n([#5471](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5471))\n([822f7c9](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/822f7c9b02e6d99bdb46b5545bb2543783c01769)).\n- Made `BackendProtocol.glob` recursive for bare patterns\n([#5026](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5026))\n([32f35d5](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/32f35d5e01f460549c10365eb569978909f5c969)).\n\n_End release notes preview._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **community contributors** list and a **Special thanks** section\n(crediting the users who filed the issues this release's PRs closed) are\nappended to the GitHub release notes automatically at publish time (see\n[Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 3).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot] <248757908+langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-18T15:03:18Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/42ed9406f08dfec11369631011405c1dc650293a","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/42ed9406f08dfec11369631011405c1dc650293a","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/42ed9406f08dfec11369631011405c1dc650293a/comments","author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"fdde617eb590191162a1ebbd9a5fb6c2763ee462","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/fdde617eb590191162a1ebbd9a5fb6c2763ee462","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/fdde617eb590191162a1ebbd9a5fb6c2763ee462"}]},{"sha":"fdde617eb590191162a1ebbd9a5fb6c2763ee462","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGZkZGU2MTdlYjU5MDE5MTE2MmExZWJiZDlhNWZiNmMyNzYzZWU0NjI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-18T14:51:45Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-18T14:51:45Z"},"message":"fix(code): collapse resized chat input on double-click (#5578)\n\nFollow-up to #5524\n\nDouble-clicking the chat input resize handle now expands only from\nautomatic sizing and collapses every manually resized height around the\ncurrent draft.\n\n---\n\n`ChatInputBox.toggle_expanded` now treats any `_requested_height` as\nresized state instead of only recognizing the maximum. The regression\ntest covers a partial manual size with a multiline draft.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/f022b6eb-54bd-1086-033e-5b3afc57c85b)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"858a38e145eb3eb89f213b8c94585ca9e72cc3f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/858a38e145eb3eb89f213b8c94585ca9e72cc3f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/fdde617eb590191162a1ebbd9a5fb6c2763ee462","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhHGBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKgEQAK7PGD30s9x51VLSSAd7ZeGM\n8Fz0/Orfhik0XgAPU03f9FESaaawlVCoXJSDUP2r9ZntWW3zY7NJNuH2lVJVP8/5\npE0a5ji6kHtxMgr+fw/IHh9bphNs/Mn/Wi5VGMvKUxZL1eopL3LD3uzKavSHRwdA\nUGPJULqhXrT8kyCAGPfOJeulYpzrEbWm0VneoeMG8gKItzRHw/TstY0FYdFG4RrY\n5QnjlK5303KqRtSLzRAmfKQCP15F09bJXw4IOmCyKb/FRgeMkVfkvQGyywHhcZXQ\n62kG0tApAh01GEezsrpZZcGgJD5eoiLVtJsg6FXuASE72umiY7L8AobihV6ijFXw\nilGHN6+fsVO+5tis0khEmVinb6KB9CMdWAdWbEV4Cxy95YfP4Kf+HcEDM7LhK3K6\nAH6bGuax6DAYZSDcoma2jFOG/2R4g+SnfntN3v5g/KjAPSEyNo57gscQAYcvSstu\ntuYAOakfWMZm4LUsw2MlDPrfFzQL63g9R2wYTMK/euHzTeMYYbjkvZ8+5uqp83FI\n0wKeQh3jbdJt3BNjX0JyN60R6sHbf5fvmIL5bgI1p0/E7pH2KCxaL/XT7dpkjqSG\ngQddykxeqrWl/JBfsdhaRJ8RcqQEenaT1851L8l+tsJwQHIMJRwdG1wS0JvkVlRW\n8/ESIyzqdwYGLiN6p6Gb\n=a3i1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 858a38e145eb3eb89f213b8c94585ca9e72cc3f3\nparent e8035e78e8be9d1edfe9a131bcc0df12349f754d\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1787064705 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787064705 -0400\n\nfix(code): collapse resized chat input on double-click (#5578)\n\nFollow-up to #5524\n\nDouble-clicking the chat input resize handle now expands only from\nautomatic sizing and collapses every manually resized height around the\ncurrent draft.\n\n---\n\n`ChatInputBox.toggle_expanded` now treats any `_requested_height` as\nresized state instead of only recognizing the maximum. The regression\ntest covers a partial manual size with a multiline draft.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/f022b6eb-54bd-1086-033e-5b3afc57c85b)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-18T14:51:45Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/fdde617eb590191162a1ebbd9a5fb6c2763ee462","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/fdde617eb590191162a1ebbd9a5fb6c2763ee462","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/fdde617eb590191162a1ebbd9a5fb6c2763ee462/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"e8035e78e8be9d1edfe9a131bcc0df12349f754d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e8035e78e8be9d1edfe9a131bcc0df12349f754d","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/e8035e78e8be9d1edfe9a131bcc0df12349f754d"}]},{"sha":"e8035e78e8be9d1edfe9a131bcc0df12349f754d","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGU4MDM1ZTc4ZThiZTlkMWVkZmU5YTEzMWJjYzBkZjEyMzQ5Zjc1NGQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-18T14:48:20Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-18T14:48:20Z"},"message":"feat(code): gate `TERM_PROGRAM` resume hints (#5580)\n\nRelated #5548\n\n`TERM_PROGRAM` is now omitted from resume hints by default, with an\nexplicit config opt-in that defaults on in experimental or debug mode.\n\n---\n\nAmbient terminal exports cannot be distinguished from launch-specific\nvalues, so `features.resume_term_program` /\n`DEEPAGENTS_CODE_RESUME_TERM_PROGRAM` controls propagation. An explicit\ntrue or false value overrides the mode-dependent default; existing\nquoting, launch snapshotting, and native-Windows safeguards remain\nintact.\n\n<details><summary>Test plan</summary>\n\n- `make -C libs/code format`\n- `make -C libs/code lint`\n- Focused resume/config tests: 38 passed\n- Full-file attempts also exposed an unrelated cold-import timeout and\nan existing Rich line-wrap assertion outside this change.\n\n</details>\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/cb92eab5-7bc0-14b4-a9d2-78b0ee980b70)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd2e38a20a9e9e2bc541f332df66c9e67164a850","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/dd2e38a20a9e9e2bc541f332df66c9e67164a850"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/e8035e78e8be9d1edfe9a131bcc0df12349f754d","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhHC0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAds0QAGucdarPdkb9oBq9U5VHaIsP\nO79SS3VbsuzcdpaM3nUk3BAlJkMKPB5eol1beMVRQcVv0xTNYoWxUa0o1bfWbYiA\njzSyH+8u6CDUEmBe0/o5/opIq8+iYzO+aJxqTNQVmA4VqyAznmf71PU/nb9rUUE0\n2DpUgjfneE9K9qLBCpE1iAKteqqcadkyt0uO7kFxdvFFlIlVA4G/Se8AzOkVjmJR\nc8dcOCRGBuLQZ3OShKKU62WDulU0Oep9w0Hkh1xdnm+0A8A+SoK4/UpP/vUOF0Tm\nC1bKq8ZJUgrWgC/kCPscdfxR+A9lmrRr8iSZmnKDouD//iUb8pOrYRRT6KSFW1/R\n/by7xLI/fMdMpyUqahUYUBQIMRKlhfm+tJjIVHZxdwERx9jhmdj/r7rJVC2Nifu9\njeI5HEne6j1AVcmWHCadPS1BG3Fm27IyAGRmeKwBkh4JGiPT6pfvj1pk5CKILjIE\npHnS2oc88lDPbA2vVp9Wr5QSi7YgNm69ifutjchwv/IFdaSBRIgVBRlOlILmgUlJ\nGw9mYQv+84gFR8iinh4iZO/Y/w2ncYLyw6gcwxyAQ9J7+ZfYXy8yS/+Z09eFYNEd\nEUtnkTUHiKB4Iq6cWynmgtUaicWlNWVw+2cByOn8zrtPV2NBCfLb6Y7CJr/U8759\n3gtM/miU7W+MDnfhfqcZ\n=8Uwc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree dd2e38a20a9e9e2bc541f332df66c9e67164a850\nparent ebafb94ca4efe62d44a898edd71adc40ada08750\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1787064500 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787064500 -0400\n\nfeat(code): gate `TERM_PROGRAM` resume hints (#5580)\n\nRelated #5548\n\n`TERM_PROGRAM` is now omitted from resume hints by default, with an\nexplicit config opt-in that defaults on in experimental or debug mode.\n\n---\n\nAmbient terminal exports cannot be distinguished from launch-specific\nvalues, so `features.resume_term_program` /\n`DEEPAGENTS_CODE_RESUME_TERM_PROGRAM` controls propagation. An explicit\ntrue or false value overrides the mode-dependent default; existing\nquoting, launch snapshotting, and native-Windows safeguards remain\nintact.\n\n<details><summary>Test plan</summary>\n\n- `make -C libs/code format`\n- `make -C libs/code lint`\n- Focused resume/config tests: 38 passed\n- Full-file attempts also exposed an unrelated cold-import timeout and\nan existing Rich line-wrap assertion outside this change.\n\n</details>\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/cb92eab5-7bc0-14b4-a9d2-78b0ee980b70)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-18T14:48:20Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e8035e78e8be9d1edfe9a131bcc0df12349f754d","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/e8035e78e8be9d1edfe9a131bcc0df12349f754d","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e8035e78e8be9d1edfe9a131bcc0df12349f754d/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"ebafb94ca4efe62d44a898edd71adc40ada08750","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ebafb94ca4efe62d44a898edd71adc40ada08750","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ebafb94ca4efe62d44a898edd71adc40ada08750"}]},{"sha":"ebafb94ca4efe62d44a898edd71adc40ada08750","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGViYWZiOTRjYTRlZmU2MmQ0NGE4OThlZGQ3MWFkYzQwYWRhMDg3NTA","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-18T14:19:26Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-18T14:19:26Z"},"message":"fix(infra): grant release-comment workflow `pull-requests: write` (#5579)\n\nRelease outcome comments can now be posted successfully on merged\nrelease PRs instead of failing with a permissions error.\n\n---\n\nThe workflow granted only `pull-requests: read`, while the comparable\n`trigger-releases` job grants `pull-requests: write` for PR comments.\nThis mismatch stayed latent because every earlier run skipped the\ncomment step; the first run to reach the POST failed with HTTP 403 in\nthe [failing\nrun](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/actions/runs/32099644447/job/95597543300).\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/0d18cfc7-cb4e-51bd-5563-d15b7921bd01)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b4800bc6aaaf288a9c181f987a59652192e48426","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/b4800bc6aaaf288a9c181f987a59652192e48426"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/ebafb94ca4efe62d44a898edd71adc40ada08750","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhGnuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAetQQACOYHbPFalaW81uo/RfmpIRs\nZW4mvv+TtBvgvt1KRxtoeKRWpfbr/xrKeLjNKtLt/nUjnYiMfJOijv2eK9hdAv1e\nu4j8/CD1V0mf62niVaiJAC5CnCKgjBGvCXswjF8V3TkvB9rdVaAGMYWOpY9va8bT\ngoIVNnEhX6pKb19vgvNXdQNO91a8KYichV6tcnWCFOgD3biuI/ngiaVotQXwdMd0\n1ZXbNYl1fK0Axi9rBRl8CMrmdJ1uQCLf6SYcMILLktidRulDD4srRZuPuvW2BJ6p\nrzFFNkqgfIKaIf3t+dUsdJAQ4YAnwNolBQSiMG6k/IRmkMJ+89m2kpqTBlwXWgTo\naIk9kNI+9T8AjTof2ALyY+qGmDUK4ot0Es70tg79oMYfCod8H+L02CbOFOJ52v7D\npEWGwIR5Ri5kyCFLoeK7q4PE63lVh4CL0CSIej5NFyaK5Q03HmkJS/ORIOmLnvi8\nE/ZBLX6C7NsLTBS0C75vCTgTQkyGDGI82XNRZvkVD+fkWorExtwGvhFelc34tIq4\nN+pL6R9UdvXf3723FU11VodzBaUaWl/jwKRq8WTcT/QhpPJs/VHVOtzTXJJnCgoE\nl2nmrkF6dBX1eKpTqSYHK28ksxFcPB62JabEzkJym5nLih96qslWGdvorZwm+8ch\nIEd23jzGbxn4kJNJnzB3\n=DbYD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree b4800bc6aaaf288a9c181f987a59652192e48426\nparent 257e0350f5a738f9ab9cc53344545c6b915ef8fe\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1787062766 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787062766 -0400\n\nfix(infra): grant release-comment workflow `pull-requests: write` (#5579)\n\nRelease outcome comments can now be posted successfully on merged\nrelease PRs instead of failing with a permissions error.\n\n---\n\nThe workflow granted only `pull-requests: read`, while the comparable\n`trigger-releases` job grants `pull-requests: write` for PR comments.\nThis mismatch stayed latent because every earlier run skipped the\ncomment step; the first run to reach the POST failed with HTTP 403 in\nthe [failing\nrun](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/actions/runs/32099644447/job/95597543300).\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/0d18cfc7-cb4e-51bd-5563-d15b7921bd01)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-18T14:19:27Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ebafb94ca4efe62d44a898edd71adc40ada08750","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ebafb94ca4efe62d44a898edd71adc40ada08750","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ebafb94ca4efe62d44a898edd71adc40ada08750/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api